  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Decolonizing Epistemologies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &apos;Decolonizing Epistemologies: the Disciplines and the University in relation to the Society and the World&apos; project aims to contribute to the transformation of higher education and research through decolonizing epistemologies with a cross-cutting multi-disciplinary focus on three themes: (a) knowledge production; (b) social difference and social inclusion; and (c) national, regional and global transformations.</narrative>
  </description>
